{"id":"58fa010572b8898a","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-cor-determinacy-ch.md","title":"AD versus Choice","display":"cor-determinacy-ch — AD versus Choice","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-determinacy-ch","aliases":["58-cor-determinacy-ch"],"display":"cor-determinacy-ch — AD versus Choice","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md]]","[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-determinacy-ch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-determinacy-ch</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-determinacy-ch — AD versus Choice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4cc4baec9297fd1e\" href=\"?note=4cc4baec9297fd1e\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md\">../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md\">../batch01/58-ax-ac.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\omega=\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T_\\omega=\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>（所有有限自然数序列组成的满博弈树）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Det}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Det}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（树、收益集与走子集三元决定性谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4cc4baec9297fd1e\" href=\"?note=4cc4baec9297fd1e\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md\">../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（集合函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AD}_S,\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AD}_S,\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}\\)</span> (不含选择公理的 Zermelo–Fraenkel 背景理论)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ad\\text{-}abbreviation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AD}_S\\leftrightarrow\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{Det}(T_\\omega,A,\\omega)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ad\\text{-}abbreviation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AD}_S\\leftrightarrow\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{Det}(T_\\omega,A,\\omega)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ac\\text{-}abbreviation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AC}_S\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\;\\left(\\emptyset\\notin F\\to\n\\exists f\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(f,F,\\bigcup F)\\land\n\\forall A\\in F\\;(f(A)\\in A)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ac\\text{-}abbreviation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AC}_S\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\;\\left(\\emptyset\\notin F\\to\n\\exists f\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(f,F,\\bigcup F)\\land\n\\forall A\\in F\\;(f(A)\\in A)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}choice} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\n\\mathrm{AD}_S\\to\\neg\\mathrm{AC}_S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}choice} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\n\\mathrm{AD}_S\\to\\neg\\mathrm{AC}_S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在 ZF+AD 中不能把实数基数无条件识别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_2\">\\(\\aleph_2\\)</span>；原断言混淆了 AD、HOD 内部结论及可良序基数。</li>\n<li>稳健的直接推论是 AD 与 AC 不相容；文件名中的 “ch” 是历史名称，本结论不是 CH 的推论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md","status":"resolved","id":"4cc4baec9297fd1e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md","status":"resolved","id":"4cc4baec9297fd1e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Det}\\subseteq V^3$（树、收益集与走子集三元决定性谓词, see [[../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$（集合函数谓词, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T_\\omega=\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Det}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AD}_S,\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ad\\text{-}abbreviation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AD}_S\\leftrightarrow\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{Det}(T_\\omega,A,\\omega)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ac\\text{-}abbreviation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AC}_S\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\;\\left(\\emptyset\\notin F\\to\n\\exists f\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(f,F,\\bigcup F)\\land\n\\forall A\\in F\\;(f(A)\\in A)\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}choice} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\n\\mathrm{AD}_S\\to\\neg\\mathrm{AC}_S","display":true},{"tex":"\\aleph_2","display":false}],"bytes":1542,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-cor-determinacy-ch.md|58-cor-determinacy-ch]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["4cc4baec9297fd1e","b3dac4cf78c440c7","36d7463d215be751"]}